<StaticPageLayout meta={meta}>
  <p>
    These are the terms for using Picmal. I'm Alberto from <strong
      >Cantimplora Studio, LLC</strong
    >, and I built Picmal to be the image converter I wanted to use myself. By
    using Picmal, you're agreeing to these terms. They're pretty
