  <H2>What Picmal is</H2>

  <p>
    Picmal is a Mac app that converts images between different formats.
    Everything happens on your computer. Your images never leave your Mac, and I
    never see them. It's that simple.
  </p>

  <H2>What you can do with Picmal</H2>

  <p>When you buy Picmal, you can:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Install it on one Mac at a time (you can transfer between devices)</li>
    <li>Use it for personal stuff or work—whatever you need</li>
    <li>Convert as many images as you want, forever</li>
    <li>Get all future updates for free</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    Starting from version 1.1.3, you'll need to activate your license within the
    app using your license key.
  </p>

  <H2>What you can't do</H2>

